@startuml
title Sequence Diagram UC-06 Melihat Daftar dan Peta Laporan
autonumber
actor "Admin Polres / Operator Polsek" as adm
boundary "DashboardPage (web)" as dsb
control "ReportService" as lap
entity "Incident" as kjd
entity "Report" as lpr
control "FirmsClient" as firms
boundary "NASA FIRMS API" as nasa
note over adm : 1–2. Pengguna membuka Dasbor Laporan; sistem menampilkan daftar dan peta.
adm -> dsb : buka Dasbor Laporan
dsb -> lap : GET /api/incidents?status&sector&from&to
lap -> lap : scopeFor(session): operator sees own sector only [1a]
lap -> kjd : list(filter, scope)
kjd -> lpr : primary report + duplicate count
lap --> dsb : incidents[] + overdue flag
dsb -> dsb : render map markers (Leaflet/OSM) by status
alt 2b. hasil kosong
dsb --> adm : 'Tidak ada laporan'
end
note over adm : 2a. Laporan baru masuk saat dasbor terbuka.
dsb -> lap : GET /api/stream (SSE, kept open)
lap --> dsb : event 'report-created'
note over adm : 3. Saringan diterapkan (permintaan yang sama dengan parameter baru).
note over adm : 4. Pengguna memilih Laporan; sistem membuka Halaman Detail Laporan.
adm -> dsb : pilih Laporan
dsb -> lap : GET /api/reports/:id
lap -> lpr : detail + reporter + history + duplicates
lap -> firms : fetchHotspots(bbox around location, 1 day)
firms -> nasa : GET area/csv (MODIS, VIIRS)
nasa --> firms : hotspots
firms --> lap : Hotspot[]
lap -> lap : nearest distance (haversine)
lap --> dsb : detail + EXIF/mismatch + hotspot hint
note across : Nomor HP Warga ditampilkan lengkap untuk Operator Polsek [4a]. Bila FIRMS tidak dapat dihubungi, detail tetap tampil tanpa petunjuk titik panas.
@enduml
